    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night of the Iron Dead</strong> delivers classic, round-based survival where you\u2019ll face endless waves of robots. Rack up points with each kill, grab power-ups, and use your resources to buy weapons off the wall as you battle through each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Waves</strong> \u2013 Each wave ramps up the challenge, testing your skills and endurance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups and Wall Buys</strong> \u2013 Boost your chances with power-ups and pick up weapons from wall buys as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks and Mystery Box</strong> \u2013 Mix up your loadout with different perks and mystery box weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Enemies</strong> \u2013 These bots are relentless and will hunt you down each round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line and see how many rounds you can survive in <strong>Night of the Iron Dead</strong>.</p>",
